	<text xml:lang="la">
		<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" subtype="metadata" n="1">Die unvollständige Jahresangabe (vgl. unten Z. 23 und Anm. b) ist, gestützt durch die Mitteilung des Todes von <persName ref="p4400" cert="high">Hans Briner</persName> und die Empfehlung des <persName ref="p8182" cert="high">Johannes Blum</persName> (vgl. auch unten <ref target="file11028">Nr. 986</ref>, 26-31), zweifelsfrei auf 1537 zu ergänzen.</note>
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>Gratiam et pacem a deo patre per Christum.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Dominus <persName ref="p4400">Ioannes Brinerus</persName>, ecclesię <lb xml:id="p1z2"/><placeName ref="l556">Superioris Vituduri</placeName> episcopus, hinc migravit ad superos calendis <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>aprilibus<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">am 1. April.</note>, quem sane dominus morte nimis immatura eripuit <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>gravissima sue ecclesie iactura, nisi non dicenda iactura tanti <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>viri amissio adeoque pastoris, quos ego sciam, absit verbo invidia, <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vigilantissimi.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Dii faxint, ut senatus noster <placeName ref="l587">Thigurinus</placeName> virum aliquem <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>bonum eidem ecclesie frequentissime praeficiat, si non per omnia parem <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>extincto, at saltem pietate et eruditione haud inferiorem, qui et <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>verbo et vite castimonia doceat.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quod ego sane ex animo cupio <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>votique me compotem fore facile crediderim, nisi me meus fallit <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>animus, si <persName ref="p8182">Floro</persName><note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3"><persName ref="p8182">Johannes Blum</persName>.</note>, ecclesie <placeName ref="l571">Vulfflingensis</placeName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><placeName ref="l571">Wülflingen</placeName> (<placeName ref="l555">Winterthur</placeName>).</note> paroeciano, <placeName ref="l555">Vitudurensis</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>capituli decano, hec demandaretur provintia.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Est enim vir vere Pius <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>iuxta ac doctus, cui dominus et gratiam et prudentiam prae aliis multis magis <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>insignem pulchre admodum functionem hanc episcopalem admini<lb xml:id="p1z15"/>strandi.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Atqui alias, dii boni, quam curta est suppellex, quam tenuis est <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>fortuna, cuius alende familie<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a"><hi>vor</hi> familie <hi>gestrichenes</hi> fortune.</note> annui reditus parum respondent.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>Auctus liberis octo deinde quoque matrem habet adhuc superstitem provecte e<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tatis, pauperculam atque cecam.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Hunc igitur <persName ref="p8182">Florem</persName> nostrum haud <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>emarcidum fratres apud nos omnes tue humanitati vehementer <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>commendant id ipsumque ultro, inrogati, ut me dii bene ament, ut eum <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>adiutes, quantum potes, si ita tibi atque vobis omnibus tali episcopatu <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>dignus videbitur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Vale feliciter atque ama <persName ref="p8407">Lutium</persName> tuum vicissim, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>qui te amat effusissime.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Anno 15[37]<note xml:id="fnb" type="footnote" n="b"><hi>in der Vorlage</hi> D. D. D. <hi>Zur Datierung vgl. Anm. 1.</hi></note>, tertio nonarum aprilium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><pb type="edition" next="131"/><persName ref="p8051">Coniugem</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>tuam<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8051">Anna Adlischwyler</persName>.</note> charissimam ac <persName ref="p7042">matrem</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p7042">Anna Wiederkehr</persName>.</note> cum tota familia<note xml:id="fnc" type="footnote" n="c"><hi>vom Schreiber korrigiert aus</hi> familiam.</note> salvas esse cupio.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/><persName ref="p8407">H. Lutius</persName>, ex animo tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Domino <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>apud <placeName ref="l587">Thigurinos</placeName> episcopo <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>vigilantissimo ac <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>primario, fratri suo <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>cumprimis <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>charo.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
